// TIME + GC support (native runtime; rolling)
//
// This file is a small include wrapper so the runtime stays reviewable.
//
// It previously grew beyond the repo's large-file comfort limit; split into:
// - 100_time_core.oren: TIME primitives + monotonic time + GC config helpers
// - 100_time_gc_stw.oren: stop-the-world safepoint protocol
// - 100_time_gc_alloc.oren: GC alloc index + cstr0/static tracking + tooling pins
//
// NOTE: include order is semantically significant.

